      "id": "claim_ebfca1c200774ab9867aa0e4c16356d8",
      "statement": "All MCP tools, resources, and the brijio-context prompt are registered in createBrijioMcpServer in servers/mcp/src/mcp-server.ts; the server holds no page state and relays requests over a short-lived WebSocket.",
