      "statement": "Before the transport handles a request, the HTTP handler enforces path match (/health and the configured MCP path), OPTIONS preflight, MCP_HTTP_ALLOWED_ORIGINS origin allow-listing with wildcard DNS suffix support, MCP_HTTP_AUTH_TOKEN bearer auth (required, throws if empty), and a GET/POST/DELETE method allowlist.",
