      "statement": "Every action and read tool accepts optional browserInstanceId and tabId string inputs declared once in createBrijioMcpServer and threaded to the WebSocket envelope; omitted browserInstanceId auto-routes only when one browser is online, BRIJIO_BROWSER_INSTANCE_ID sets a process default, and omitted tabId falls back to the active foreground tab.",
