    {
      "id": "claim_4a51747dd8ba4bc9b3ce40d92cc38568",
      "statement": "Per ADR 0061, router-level errors forward the original code and message as-is (only malformed envelopes become invalid_response) and action-level errors forward the original extension code (e.g. not_supported, cors_blocked) instead of flattening to browser_error; stale_context and page_navigated keep their structured detail. BrijioToolResult error code is typed as string so unknown codes pass through.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/architecture/decisions/0061-forward-error-codes-through-mcp.md#L60-L130",
